      "review_description": "It was a real pleasure to deal with such a knowledgable, efficient and honest consultant.  He focused on the facts and there was no hard sell just a good price and quality products.  Cannot recommend this company highly enough for those seeking quality advice, products and service.  Although I didn't opt for the cheapest system, preferring to go for the Kyocera panels and German SMA inverter, I feel confident that I made the right decision because having done extensive research, these are the best panels in the market.",
